    └── The code uses attr.s with slots=True, auto_attribs=True, and attr.ib with init=False for fields populated in 
        __attrs_post_init__. Python's standard library dataclasses (3.7+) supports equivalent patterns: @dataclass(slots=True), 
        field(init=False), and __post_init__ for post-initialization logic. The auto_attribs=True behavior maps directly to 
        type-annotated fields in dataclasses.

